      "Uses configurable tone, length, context, and file count settings.",
      "Shows the draft for review without creating the commit."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "It only analyzes changes that are staged in Git.",
      "It does not know unstaged work unless you stage it first.",
      "It does not create, stage, or modify commits for you.",
